{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The original is delightfully spare: a live millisecond timestamp printed on a black shirt, fitted/unisex controls, four sizes, and a $22.50 free-shipping checkout. I’m keeping that core interaction while modernizing it to a Stripe-hosted Checkout flow (safer for a production starting point) with server-side Scalable Press fulfillment."}}
